async function fetchJson(url,headers={}){const r=await fetch(url,{headers:{accept:'application/json',...headers},signal:AbortSignal.timeout(10000)});if(!r.ok){const error=new Error('Source returned HTTP '+r.status);error.http_status=r.status;const retry=r.headers.get('Retry-After');if(retry){const seconds=Number(retry);error.retry_after=Number.isFinite(seconds)?Date.now()+Math.max(0,seconds)*1000:Date.parse(retry)}throw error;}return r.json()}
